  "identifier": "tidepool",
  "name": "Tidepool",
  "description": "Open-source nonprofit diabetes data platform that aggregates, visualises, and shares data from 50+ diabetes devices including CGMs (Dexcom, Abbott FreeStyle Libre), insulin pumps (Tandem, Omnipod, Medtronic), and APS systems. Enables patients to share structured diabetes data with clinicians, caregivers, and researchers. The Tidepool Loop automated insulin delivery algorithm is commercially distributed by Sequel Med Tech as twiist Loop. Governed as a US 501(c)(3) nonprofit. BSD-2-Clause, Go-based backend, active development.",
  "url": "https://www.tidepool.org/",
