  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source diabetes data platform — aggregates data from 50+ devices and connects patients, clinicians, and researchers. US 501(c)(3) nonprofit, BSD-2-Clause, active development. The Tidepool Loop APS algorithm is commercially distributed via Sequel Med Tech. Complements Nightscout in the MACH catalog: Nightscout is the community CGM remote monitor; Tidepool is the structured diabetes data platform with clinical and research integrations.",
